      "en": "God met Balaam, and he said to him, “I have prepared the seven altars, and I have offered up a bull and a ram on every altar.”",
      "ko": "하나님이 발람에게 임하시는지라 발람이 고하되 내가 일곱 단을 베풀고 매단에 수송아지 하나와 수양 하나를 드렸나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "6eaa08e93acb64657fd5bc041ab4b9a6440b0e79546386aed12fc10411be93be",
      "translation_text_hash": "a9ab3def662e9ff7bf3200ae64902b3d52cbbbea1d8d8b3193b5316ff5b0dbc8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
