      "en": "The LORD put a word in Balaam’s mouth, and said, “Return to Balak, and thus you shall speak.”",
      "ko": "여호와께서 발람의 입에 말씀을 주어 가라사대 발락에게 돌아가서 이렇게 말할찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "89a48d31d99ed0e2f922f3dd10c1584f1238a799ef2d2260300df25eff5c432f",
      "translation_text_hash": "c1de7971e419b065735caeb7ccdd4f7a1bcd12c13177fe47a2b938f87a25e5f1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
