      "en": "How shall I curse whom God has not cursed? How shall I defy whom the LORD has not defied?",
      "ko": "하나님이 저주치 않으신 자를 내 어찌 저주하며 여호와께서 꾸짖지 않으신 자를 내 어찌 꾸짖을꼬",
      "source_text_hash": "192e02398398f802194303cf7029ece95a7dec9005c5d8bc2d439de3baa2f9fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "d956c3170d0af386bfadd4c16e1f0a3b1ff22df51ab0dd5bd4d8e0bd44c1bf38",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
