      "en": "God is not a man, that he should lie, nor a son of man, that he should repent. Has he said, and he won’t do it? Or has he spoken, and he won’t make it good?",
      "ko": "하나님은 인생이 아니시니 식언치 않으시고 인자가 아니시니 후회가 없으시도다 어찌 그 말씀하신 바를 행치 않으시며 하신 말씀을 실행치 않으시랴",
      "source_text_hash": "965c3c6b478649e8cc4df46a49565a1ba737fa972b038bfb1a93b6caeee1510d",
      "translation_text_hash": "0724edc04f9bc50b8da891cfdbf01a42a9bd1f572130d4e1ee49613b960e20dc",
